Package: jungey-live
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Jungey OS <jungey@localhost>
Depends: calamares, casper, sudo
Description: Jungey OS live session and installer settings
 Configures the Calamares installer for Jungey OS and puts an install
 launcher on the live desktop. The installer removes this package from the
 system it installs.
